flowchart TD
  A[Entry] --> B[Overview]
  B --> C{Choose surface}
  C --> D[Collection]
  C --> E[Form]
  D --> F[Inspect item]
  F --> G[Edit or return]
  E --> H{Validate}
  H -->|Valid| I[Confirm]
  H -->|Invalid| J[Inline correction]
  J --> H
  I --> K[Success feedback]
  K --> B
  B --> L[Guidance]
  L --> B
  D --> M[No content]
  M --> E
  D --> N[Failure]
  N --> O[Retry]
  O --> D
Rationale: paths are short, reversible, and explicit about validation, empty conditions, success, and recovery.